On Wed, Aug 12, 2026 at 01:18:33PM +0200, David Heidelberg wrote:
> > Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-4-8
> > Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5
> > Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
